{"body_markdown":"","change_reason":"2026-09-17 AI依据已保存正文和固定结果补写独立阅读所需背景、定义、经过及边界；不新增实验，不改变科学确认状态。","content_hash":"7c6c4c3c6c2c6b0ea2ae24383e8d34da165a8bf9d40a04d82360f443eab04998","created_at":"2026-09-08T22:09:00.547490Z","created_by":{"id":"codex-development-agent-default-skill-acceptance","kind":"ai"},"discovery":"workspace_summary","keywords":["浮点求和","数值稳定性","detail"],"kind":"detail","level":"L1","owner_id":"RES-FLOATING-POINT-SUMMATION","payload":{"blocks":[{"block_id":"standalone-context","markdown":"## 本条问题、比较条件与判据\n\n本研究比较有限精度求和在“大数与小量共存，随后正负大数抵消”的输入上是否丢失小量。输入是保存脚本实际接收的有限 binary64（53位有效精度的双精度浮点）数，均无量纲；原复核环境为 CPython 3.12.10、Windows 11 x64。\n\n参考值把每个实际浮点输入精确转换为有理数后相加。记输入为 $x_i$（$i=1,\\ldots,n$，$n$为项数）、算法返回值为 $\\widehat S$，则\n\n$$S_{\\rm ref}=\\sum_{i=1}^{n}\\operatorname{Fraction}(x_i),\\qquad e_{\\rm abs}=\\left|\\operatorname{Fraction}(\\widehat S)-S_{\\rm ref}\\right|.$$\n\n`Fraction`表示精确有理数转换；“精确命中”指绝对误差 $e_{\\rm abs}=0$，不使用容差。这只检查已表示浮点数的求和误差，不混入十进制文本转换误差。\n\n显式逐项累加从0开始按顺序加每个输入，每次加法立即舍入。Kahan把上步丢失量保存在补偿变量中，下一步先修正输入；Neumaier按当前和与输入的幅值选择校正式，并把累计校正在末尾加入。`math.fsum`是Python标准库的求和对照，本研究只核对其返回值，没有采集内部轨迹。\n\n方法依据：浮点求和方法：精确基准、递推与适用条件，MEM-4acc73bb-59c7-560d-9415-fd42e9dcaa2d r1。原实验输入、结果及图表的固定来源保持在本条 evidence_refs 中。","requires_block_ids":[],"role":"introduction"},{"block_id":"inputs","markdown":"## 设计与采样\n\n将三项序列$[10^{16},1,-10^{16}]$重复10次，得到30项多重集合。每个样本含10个正大数、10个1和10个负大数，精确和均为10；对这一集合保存30种排列。\n\n| 参数 | 取值 | 用途与范围 |\n|---|---:|---|\n| 大数幅值 | $10^{16}$ | 保持前两组的舍入尺度 |\n| 三项重复次数 | 10 | 小量精确总和为10 |\n| 每个排列项数 | 30 | 有限长度，不检验长序列极限 |\n| 排列样本数 | 30 | 不是总体失败概率估计 |\n| 随机种子 | 20260909 | 固定采样配方，复核优先读取保存数组 |\n\n原配方创建`rng = random.Random(20260909)`，每次重置`values = ['1e16', '1', '-1e16'] * 10`，再调用`rng.shuffle(values)`；30次连续使用同一个随机数生成器。已有独立采样核对表明，在所记录的Python环境中，生成的30组、每组30项数组与保存输入逐项一致。其他Python版本不能仅凭同一seed推断排列完全相同。","requires_block_ids":["standalone-context"],"role":"inputs"},{"block_id":"checks","markdown":"## 计算与检查\n\n读取固定数组后，对每组运行与第二组相同的四种实现。逐项累加、Kahan和Neumaier保存每一步的当前和、补偿值与精确前缀误差；math.fsum仅保留实际返回值。每个输出按独立方法章计算相对于精确和10的绝对误差，不用浮点容差判定精确性。\n\n本轮共120个方法输出已在后续复核中与原结果逐项比较。下表和图保留全部30个样本的汇总，不挑选单个有利排列。","requires_block_ids":["inputs"],"role":"methods"},{"block_id":"results","markdown":"## 结果与误差分布\n\n| 方法 | 精确命中/样本数 | 最大绝对误差 |\n|---|---:|---:|\n| 显式逐项累加 | 0/30 | 10 |\n| Kahan | 5/30 | 10 |\n| Neumaier | 30/30 | 0 |\n| math.fsum | 30/30 | 0 |\n\n![30组固定排列的精确命中数与最大绝对误差](figure:0)\n\n| 方法 | 绝对误差 → 出现次数 |\n|---|---|\n| 显式逐项累加 | 2 → 1；4 → 1；5 → 2；6 → 5；8 → 2；9 → 4；10 → 15 |\n| Kahan | 0 → 5；1 → 2；2 → 12；4 → 2；5 → 4；6 → 4；10 → 1 |\n| Neumaier | 0 → 30 |\n| math.fsum | 0 → 30 |\n\n![全部30个保存排列的绝对误差序列；纵轴无量纲](figure:1)\n\nKahan在5组排列中精确，在另外25组中仍有误差；其中1组的绝对误差达到10。因此，增加项数后，所选抵消结构仍能产生反例。Neumaier与math.fsum本次30组均精确，但这仍是有限构造样本，不能估计真实数据分布上的失败概率，也没有覆盖非整数、极端指数或运行时间。","requires_block_ids":["inputs"],"role":"results"}],"evidence_refs":[{"locator":"全文","relation":"input","revision":null,"sha256":"16afde15315ac4f45463c1f3124a3e7d886398e8c09c6fb9adfdc19e43bd228d","target_id":"SRC-SUMMATION-DETAIL-R03","target_kind":"file"},{"locator":"run.json","relation":"input","revision":null,"sha256":"1db68adb0974c4e43d572b9d8c6956c0cd941ca74effbc1769da27febb7f5408","target_id":"RUN-20260908T201240Z-90107A617CF8","target_kind":"owner"},{"locator":"run.json","relation":"input","revision":null,"sha256":"8efe2879a142667db6d174693fc5738228e9904902d7a2c884e720d75d014b05","target_id":"RUN-20260908T215458Z-04C7D84D40D8","target_kind":"owner"},{"locator":"全文","relation":"input","revision":null,"sha256":"9da1f46663a569680b3e61e842f164880d24c047e0ab13ac0471df6683d32561","target_id":"SRC-SUMMATION-INPUT-R03","target_kind":"file"},{"locator":"全文","relation":"input","revision":null,"sha256":"739d2ce2c6922dc7ce74dfea9ac22d987dd6b8d353484e70c615fc96d2f22074","target_id":"SRC-SUMMATION-TRACE-VERIFY","target_kind":"file"},{"locator":"全文","relation":"input","revision":null,"sha256":"d7348aca67bf17dc4369a7b8d756b2193571b8c6f7010cc0efb6557ef409da8c","target_id":"SRC-SUMMATION-OP-TRACES","target_kind":"file"},{"locator":"全文","relation":"input","revision":null,"sha256":"7759b89aa016be03e7f18169240dd308c28b21bfafac980c92cbce36bfeeaeee","target_id":"SRC-SUMMATION-FIGURE-R03","target_kind":"file"},{"locator":"全文","relation":"input","revision":null,"sha256":"0fdc0ea6ef408adaf2c7c5c2e56fd0f72e95db032a30d5fc344e3cf9e21bd456","target_id":"SRC-SUMMATION-FIGURE-PERMUTATIONS","target_kind":"file"},{"locator":"全文","relation":"input","revision":null,"sha256":"8fc77120e5495b853becd8d160ae84f8c135318eec5dda1f8108b68dd5dfc52d","target_id":"SRC-SUMMATION-SAMPLING-VERIFY","target_kind":"file"},{"locator":"全文","relation":"input","revision":null,"sha256":"bf89c9889ac3795214b21b6a3d19557750da1304fc60fb58d63d119784e7ceed","target_id":"SRC-SUMMATION-REPORT-V2-METHODS","target_kind":"file"},{"locator":"全文","relation":"input","revision":null,"sha256":"be64d72d7648d1463ab8e007d18b984b418601794fad391c6dec047af5f5ac6d","target_id":"SRC-SUMMATION-REPORT-V2-ROUND-03","target_kind":"file"},{"locator":"完整正文与固定依据","relation":"references","revision":1,"sha256":"ba12342c6ca8afa0a1760dc517fd7bff2d1b60c7f082ee9113e419572834df51","target_id":"MEM-4acc73bb-59c7-560d-9415-fd42e9dcaa2d","target_kind":"record"}],"figures":[{"caption":"第3轮精确命中数和最大绝对误差，横轴方法，误差无量纲","ref":{"locator":"全文","relation":"input","revision":null,"sha256":"7759b89aa016be03e7f18169240dd308c28b21bfafac980c92cbce36bfeeaeee","target_id":"SRC-SUMMATION-FIGURE-R03","target_kind":"file"}},{"caption":"第三轮全部30个固定排列的绝对误差序列","ref":{"locator":"全文","relation":"input","revision":null,"sha256":"0fdc0ea6ef408adaf2c7c5c2e56fd0f72e95db032a30d5fc344e3cf9e21bd456","target_id":"SRC-SUMMATION-FIGURE-PERMUTATIONS","target_kind":"file"}}],"missing_refs":[],"retrieval_description":{"applicable":["第3轮保存的构造输入、实现和环境。"],"key_findings":["逐项累加0/30、Kahan5/30，最大误差均10；Neumaier与math.fsum各30/30、误差0。"],"limitations":["非整数、极端指数、跨平台和性能未验证；研究not-reviewed。"],"method":"读取对应固定构造输入，按已保存实现与精确有理数和比较；本文仅重新组织既有完整说明。","not_applicable":["任意输入的正确性或真实数据分布成功概率。"],"question":"同类反例能否延续至30项的多种排列？"},"run_ref":{"locator":"run.json","relation":"input","revision":null,"sha256":"1db68adb0974c4e43d572b9d8c6956c0cd941ca74effbc1769da27febb7f5408","target_id":"RUN-20260908T201240Z-90107A617CF8","target_kind":"owner"},"unit_type":"experiment"},"previous_revision":3,"provenance_gap":null,"record_hash":"41e071e700ec9ddf3a7e779a5180d1794addcee82af21a25c6a0342dbca8e350","record_id":"MEM-96f79923-f023-509e-a002-40f2d5a4fca1","record_reason":"使本条正文脱离对话及相邻记录仍能理解问题、依据、结果和使用边界。","revision":4,"schema_version":3,"sensitivity":"internal","sources":[{"locator":"全文","relation":"input","revision":null,"sha256":"16afde15315ac4f45463c1f3124a3e7d886398e8c09c6fb9adfdc19e43bd228d","target_id":"SRC-SUMMATION-DETAIL-R03","target_kind":"file"},{"locator":"run.json","relation":"input","revision":null,"sha256":"1db68adb0974c4e43d572b9d8c6956c0cd941ca74effbc1769da27febb7f5408","target_id":"RUN-20260908T201240Z-90107A617CF8","target_kind":"owner"},{"locator":"run.json","relation":"input","revision":null,"sha256":"8efe2879a142667db6d174693fc5738228e9904902d7a2c884e720d75d014b05","target_id":"RUN-20260908T215458Z-04C7D84D40D8","target_kind":"owner"},{"locator":"全文","relation":"input","revision":null,"sha256":"9da1f46663a569680b3e61e842f164880d24c047e0ab13ac0471df6683d32561","target_id":"SRC-SUMMATION-INPUT-R03","target_kind":"file"},{"locator":"全文","relation":"input","revision":null,"sha256":"739d2ce2c6922dc7ce74dfea9ac22d987dd6b8d353484e70c615fc96d2f22074","target_id":"SRC-SUMMATION-TRACE-VERIFY","target_kind":"file"},{"locator":"全文","relation":"input","revision":null,"sha256":"d7348aca67bf17dc4369a7b8d756b2193571b8c6f7010cc0efb6557ef409da8c","target_id":"SRC-SUMMATION-OP-TRACES","target_kind":"file"},{"locator":"全文","relation":"input","revision":null,"sha256":"7759b89aa016be03e7f18169240dd308c28b21bfafac980c92cbce36bfeeaeee","target_id":"SRC-SUMMATION-FIGURE-R03","target_kind":"file"},{"locator":"全文","relation":"input","revision":null,"sha256":"0fdc0ea6ef408adaf2c7c5c2e56fd0f72e95db032a30